# The pages' shared parts. A folder with a qmldir exposes only the types it
# names, so every file here is listed. Accents is a singleton: one object
# for every page, so the swatches are read once however many pages show them.
singleton Accents 1.0 Accents.qml
AccentSwatch 1.0 AccentSwatch.qml
DeskPreview 1.0 DeskPreview.qml
Flick 1.0 Flick.qml
Point 1.0 Point.qml
Run 1.0 Run.qml
